<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Pagamento Pix</title>
    <style>
        body { background: #0f0f0f; color: white; font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding-top: 50px; }
        .pix-box { background: #1a1a1a; width: 400px; margin: auto; padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #f1c40f; }
        .qr-fake { background: white; width: 200px; height: 200px; margin: 20px auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: black; font-weight: bold; border: 10px solid #f1c40f; }
        .btn-back { background: #f1c40f; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; color: black; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="pix-box">
        <h2>Confirmação de Compra</h2>
        <p>Você está comprando <b><%= cashAmount %> Cash</b></p>
        <p>Escaneie o QR Code (SIMULADO) abaixo:</p>
        <div class="qr-fake">QR CODE FAKE</div>
        <p>Após pagar, avise o ADM no Discord!</p>
        <a href="/shop" class="btn-back">VOLTAR PARA LOJA</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
